{"id":75,"date":"2023-04-27T01:57:55","date_gmt":"2023-04-27T01:57:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/?post_type=chancellors_msg&#038;p=75"},"modified":"2025-04-04T07:10:18","modified_gmt":"2025-04-04T07:10:18","slug":"dr-v-praveen-rao","status":"publish","type":"chancellors_msg","link":"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/chancellors_msg\/dr-v-praveen-rao\/","title":{"rendered":"Dr. V. PRAVEEN RAO"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to Kaveri University \u2013 a Multidisciplinary Education and Research Institution. Our enduring mission is to provide students with an invigorating academic environment, cutting-edge research, extracurricular facilities, and strong agroindustry connections\u2014all of which will give you a lead in shaping the future. A future that continues to expand and accelerate exponentially, bringing with it ample opportunities and challenges in an interconnected world for our students, researchers, industry, and communities to appreciate and understand.<\/p>\n<p>As you embark upon your journey at our university, I encourage you to push yourself outside of your comfort zone and explore all of the opportunities that await you. Our dedicated, well-trained faculty and staff are here to support you along the way as you pursue your academic and professional goals.<\/p>\n<p>We intend to equip our students through a value-based curriculum coupled with year-long experiential learning and the much-needed 21st-century skills that will enable them to leave a positive impact on society. Whether through joining the workforce, continuing further studies, launching an entrepreneurial venture, or forging a different path, I am sure Kaveri\u2019s graduates will bring their \u2018Think, Do, and Lead\u2019 spirit into the world.<\/p>\n<p>At our university, we value inclusivity, diversity, equity, professional ethics, and environmental sustainability. We strive to create a welcoming environment that fosters a sense of community and belonging for all students, regardless of their background or identity. We believe that a diverse and inclusive environment promotes creativity, innovation, and excellence.<\/p>\n<p>I am confident that with your hard work and dedication, along with the support of our faculty and staff, you will achieve great things during your time here. Looking forward to celebrating your journey and success with us!!!<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/V-Praveen-Rao-List-of-Publications.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary btn-wide btn-brand-blue\" tabindex=\"-1\">Publications<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to Kaveri University \u2013 a Multidisciplinary Education and Research Institution. Our enduring mission is to &#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":231,"template":"","class_list":["post-75","chancellors_msg","type-chancellors_msg","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.2 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Dr. V. PRAVEEN RAO - Kaveri University<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/chancellors_msg\/dr-v-praveen-rao\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Dr. V. PRAVEEN RAO - Kaveri University\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to Kaveri University \u2013 a Multidisciplinary Education and Research Institution. Our enduring mission is to ...\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/kaveriuniversity.edu.in\/chancellors_msg\/dr-v-praveen-rao\/\" \/>\n<meta property